  "description": "The Sythe is the new evolution of the T-160. Click here to see the new Whyte Sythe\n\nThrive everywhere\nAgile, fast, capable and engineered for enduro, our 'Trail Bike Of The Year' award-winning T-160 RS is ready for everything you can throw at it: double-black diamond descents, pinning Alpine lines, bikepark surfing, climbing mountain passes, or between the tapes enduro racing. Whether you ride, roam or race, it's tuned to give you every possible speed and style advantage, everywhere.\n\nHighlights\n– 160mm front and 150mm of rear suspension travel.\n– 6061 aluminium SCR frame with ISCG 2 guide mounts + geometry adjustment.\n– RockShox Lyrik Ultimate RC2 29in fork + Super Deluxe RC2T DebonAir shock\n– SRAM GX Eagle 1x12 speed transmission (32T chainring x 10-52T cassette).\n– 29in chaos taming wheels front and rear.\n– Can be converted to MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) for an even more gravity-focused ride.",
